摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"deepseek-harness dsh thinging levels 调整 reasoning强度调整","id":"gh:1338572270","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-thinking-levels","slug":"drscrewdriver/dsh-thinking-levels","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-bundle","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-plugins","node","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"deepseek-harness dsh thinging levels 调整 reasoning强度调整"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-thinking-levels"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Per-round thinking-level (`reasoning_effort`) control for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): pick `Auto` (a m"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ask) in the session model selector and the plugin schedules `low` / `high` / `max` from the recent t"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ool-call history before submitting the API effort — or fix a wire level (`off` / `on` / `minimal` / "},{"id":"p3s4","text":"`low` / `medium` / `high` / `xhigh` / `max`) manually. Cheap tool rounds stay cheap; heavy work neve"},{"id":"p3s5","text":"ium` / `high` / `xhigh` / `max`) manually. Cheap tool rounds stay cheap; heavy work never starves.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"- English README\n> **v0.7.0-beta.1 (2026-09-06): the short-circuit route is retired.** This release "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"no longer depends on `dsh-llm-openai-completions` — custom-gateway fixes ride the official `llm-pi-a"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"i` compat surface (requires **dsh ≥ v0.1.2-alpha.1**); keep the adapter plugin uninstalled. See the "},{"id":"p4s4","text":"surface (requires **dsh ≥ v0.1.2-alpha.1**); keep the adapter plugin uninstalled. See the CHANGELOG."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- 中文 README\n- 日本語 README\n- 한국어 README\n- README en français\n- Deutsche README\n- README in italiano\n- "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"README на русском\n- README en español\n- Installation guide\n- 中文安装指南\n- 日本語インストールガイド\n- 한국어 설치 안내\n- Gui"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"de d'installation en français\n- Installationsanleitung auf Deutsch\n- Guida all'installazione in ital"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"iano\n- Руководство по установке на русском\n- Guía de instalación en español\n- Changelog\n- 日本語 change"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"log\n- 한국어 changelog\n- Changelog en français\n- Changelog auf Deutsch\n- Changelog in italiano\n- Список"},{"id":"p5s6","text":" изменений на русском\n- Changelog en español"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> **▼ DSH version support**\n>\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Screenshots of the live UI (dsh web):"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Native model selector gains Auto — pick it and the plugin schedules low/high/max per step instead of"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" a fixed wire level."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Thinking-level settings, 3.0.x card (screenshot kept for reference). Since 3.1.0 / DSH 0.1.7 the lev"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"el, enable and scheduler toggles render as a host-generated declarative form; the custom card and it"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"s llm-pi-ai capability editor were removed with the retired seat."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Per-model capability card, 3.0.x (screenshot kept for reference). Since 3.1.0 / DSH 0.1.7 the capabi"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"lity editor ships no more; edit `llm-pi-ai` model capabilities through the official Models settings "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"tor ships no more; edit `llm-pi-ai` model capabilities through the official Models settings instead."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Levels"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Level | Meaning | Where |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| `off` | thinking disabled (manual only — never auto-picked) | model selector / default level |\n| `"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"on` | thinking enabled (toggle-only models only): sends `enable_thinking`, never a think effort | mo"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"del selector / default level |\n| `minimal` | least effort (very light tasks) | model selector / defa"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"ult level |\n| `low` | manual pick for simple chat tasks (cheap rounds stay cheap) | model selector /"},{"id":"p14s5","text":" default level |\n| `medium` | medium effort | model selector / default level |\n| `high` | the offici"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"al default effort | model selector / default level |\n| `xhigh` | extra high effort | model selector "},{"id":"p14s7","text":"/ default level |\n| `max` | heavy work | model selector / default level |\n| `auto` | **mask**: sched"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"ule per step from the recent tool-call history, resolved to a wire level before submission | model s"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"elector (injected by the plugin) / default level |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Wire-level facts (verified against the official DeepSeek docs and dsh's `llm-deepseek` adapter): `lo"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"w` maps 1:1 on deepseek-v4-flash / v4-pro, while `medium` / `xhigh` collapse onto `high`. The adapte"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"r accepts `off | low | high | max` and rejects anything else with `UNSUPPORTED_REASONING_EFFORT` — `"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"auto` is the plugin's mask layer, never sent to the API, always resolved to a concrete wire level be"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"fore injection. `on` is **not** an effort level: it is advertised only by toggle-only models (Qwen3."},{"id":"p15s6","text":"6-style), and it only flips `enable_thinking` true — no `reasoning_effort` is sent; an effort-capabl"},{"id":"p15s7","text":"e model never advertises `on`, so a manual `on` pick on one is stripped."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Custom wire mapping"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"For hand-declared `llm-pi-ai` models, map each level to the exact value your gateway expects (borrow"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ed from dsh-thinking-effort): tick a level and enter its wire value, e.g. `high` → `ultra`. The mapp"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ing is stored as the model's `reasoningEfforts` table in the `llm-pi-ai` config, so the Composer sel"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"ection `High` sends `ultra` to the gateway. Leaving `off` empty means \"do not send\"."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- Official preset: `Off / High / Max` (official DeepSeek style)\n- Generic preset: `Off / Low / Mediu"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"l preset: `Off / High / Max` (official DeepSeek style)\n- Generic preset: `Off / Low / Medium / High`"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"> The visual editor for this mapping rode the plugin's settings card, which the DSH 0.1.7 migration "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"removed (the seat no longer exists). Edit the `reasoningEfforts` table through the official Models s"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ettings surface instead — the host-side detection and injection read it live either way."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Effort slider (per model line)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The model panel's per-line effort `<select>` became a **segment slider**: click a line's effort chip"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" (it shows the effective level, or *Provider default*) and a full-width slider expands under that li"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ne. The stop count adapts to what the model advertises — two-stop toggle-only models, the official `"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"off/low/high/max` set, custom gateway wire values; `auto` (when the directory carries the mask) is p"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"inned **leftmost**, then `off`/`on`, then the strength gradient, unknown wire values last."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Since 4.4.0 the selector's own effort chip shows the **user intent**, not the scheduler's resolved l"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"evel: with the intent `auto` the main label stays **Auto** and the level actually sent in the last s"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"tep is demoted to a secondary hint (`→ low`). Note: while the model-UI takeover below is off, the *o"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"fficial* selector's chip keeps showing the last resolved level — that is host projection semantics t"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"he plugin cannot restyle."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Interaction follows the approved dsh-reasoning-effort visual baseline: the thumb follows the pointer"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" continuously and **snaps on release** (one route write per gesture), the plain thumb is pure white "},{"id":"p23s3","text":"in every theme, the thumb stays fully visible at both endpoints, and ←/→/Home/End step stop-by-stop."},{"id":"p23s4","text":" The select's *Provider default* reset survives as the ↺ button of the slider row."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Model UI takeover (since 4.4.0)"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Context-window presets"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Model-aware guard (v0.5.0)"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The plugin never sends a `reasoning_effort` to a model that does not advertise one. Custom\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
